0,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/355701-2026-trec-annual-cancer-research-symposium","title":"2026 TREC Annual Cancer Research Symposium","status":"1","location":"","summary":"<p>\n  The Texas A&amp;M University Regional Center of Excellence in Cancer Research is delighted to invite you to the 4th Annual TREC Cancer Research Symposium. This event will be held on April 02, 2026, at the Stella Hotel in Bryan, Texas. This year\u2019s theme, \u201c<i>Advances in Cancer Research<\/i>\u201d will celebrate the many areas of progress targeting cancer research.&#160;<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  We encourage you to mark your calendars and plan to attend a day of enlightening presentations, poster presentations, and an opportunity to engage in collaborative discussions.<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  <strong>Details regarding event registration and a call for abstracts will be released soon. For more information, please contact the TREC Administrative Core at <a href=\"mailto:trecadmin@tamu.edu\">trecadmin@tamu.edu<\/a>.&#160;<\/strong>\n<\/p>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/webp\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.webp 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.webp 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.png 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.png\" alt=\"Image with details for the TREC Symposium event. All details mentioned in the image can be found below, such as date\/time, and location.\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,945,531\/16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2.rev.1764778987.png 2x\" data-max-w=\"945\" data-max-h=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" data-optimized=\"true\"\/>\n<\/picture>\n","image_info":["301","16716_SAVETHEDATE_2026_TREC_Symposium_2","png","1","0,0,945,531","Image with details for the TREC Symposium event. All details mentioned in the image can be found below, such as date\/time, and location.","","",""]},{"id":"371951","ts_start":1775154600,"ts_end":1775158200,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/371951-gspdt-how-to-nail-your-teaching-demonstration","title":"GSPDT: How to Nail Your Teaching Demonstration","status":"1","location":"Zoom","summary":"<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\n  <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Facilitator:<\/strong> Jasmine Zenn Vei, Center for Teaching Excellence\n<\/p>\n<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n  <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Description:<\/strong> In this workshop, we will get into the concept of teaching demonstration and learn how to design it based on the course design cycle. Participants will be able to plan their own teaching demonstration by the end of this session.\n<\/p>\n<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n  <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Learning Outcomes:<\/strong> Participants will be able to\u2026\n<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ak-ol\" start=\"1\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"orderedList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n  <li data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n    <p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n      Define the purpose of a teaching demonstration.\n    <\/p>\n  <\/li>\n  <li data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n    <p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n      Explain how the course design cycle can guide the planning of a teaching demonstration.\n    <\/p>\n  <\/li>\n  <li data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n    <p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n      Give examples of strategies that will set a teaching demonstration apart from others.\n    <\/p>\n  <\/li>\n  <li data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n    <p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n      Develop a teaching demonstration plan.\n    <\/p>\n  <\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n  <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Register Here:<\/strong> <span class=\"inlineCardView-content-wrap inlineNodeView\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"inlineCard\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\"><span class=\"card\" aria-busy=\"true\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ers.tamu.edu\/register.aspx?scheduleid=46061\" data-inline-card=\"\" data-card-data=\"\">https:\/\/ers.tamu.edu\/register.aspx?scheduleid=46061<\/a><\/span><\/span>\n<\/p>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/webp\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.webp 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.webp 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png\" alt=\"'GSPDT: How to Nail Your Teaching Demonstration' Event Thumbnail\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/38\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1280,720\/16731_LiveWhale_Picture.rev.1765295412.png 3x\" data-max-w=\"1280\" data-max-h=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" data-optimized=\"true\"\/>\n<\/picture>\n","image_info":["38","16731_LiveWhale_Picture","png","1","0,0,1280,720","","","1",""]},{"id":"380640","ts_start":1775154600,"ts_end":1775188800,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/380640-lap-pool","title":"Lap Pool","status":"1","location":"","summary":"","is_starred":"","image_src":"","image_raw":""},{"id":"373756","ts_start":1775156400,"ts_end":1775160000,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/373756-questioning-clarity-strategies-for-effective","title":"Questioning Clarity: Strategies for Effective Question Formation in Communication (English Language Proficiency)","status":"1","location":"Zoom","summary":"<p>\n  <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Facilitator:<\/strong> <span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Michele Vick, Center for Teaching Excellence<\/span><br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  <strong>Description:<\/strong> <span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Mastering question formation is crucial for effective communication. In this workshop, attendees will review the grammatical structures of direct and indirect questions, and discuss how higher order questions can encourage critical thinking and foster deeper learning.<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  An optional assignment for extended practice will be available on Canvas.<\/span><br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  <strong>Learning Outcomes<\/strong>: <span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Participants will be able to\u2026<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  1. Plan and utilize questions as an instructional tool to fos